This is deterministic fake video fixture data used only to test file-size governance. It is intentionally longer than the configured 256-byte threshold. No media decoder is required because Asset Governance audits metadata and file placement rather than decoding content. The remaining padding makes this fixture reliably oversized: 0123456789ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz.
